  causeName: Durian
  headline: "Buah Durian Jatuh Mengejut,\nSeorang Terkorban"
  headlineEN: Falling durian claims one unsuspecting victim
  subhead: '"Mati sebab durian. Sebenarnya, memang worth it."'
  subheadEN: '"Death by durian. Honestly, worth it."'
  flavourText: "Wangian durian masih tercium di lokasi kejadian.\nPihak berkuasa mohon orang ramai jauhi pokok berkenaan."
